      "title": "How can I split shared household bills &amp; keep track of who&#39;s paid without a &quot;spreadsheet&quot;?",
      "body": "<p>My partner and I split rent, utilities and groceries. Right now I keep a <a href=\"https://docs.google.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Google Sheet</a> but it&#39;s a mess every month.</p>\n\n<p>What I need:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Import transactions from <strong>two different banks</strong></li>\n<li>Split each bill by a <em>custom percentage</em> (60/40)</li>\n<li>See who owes what at the end of the month</li>\n</ul>\n\n<blockquote>\n<p>I tried Splitwise but it can&#39;t import from my bank.</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<p>My current formula is:</p>\n\n<pre><code>=SUMIF(B:B, &quot;rent&quot;, C:C) * 0.6 &lt; 1000\n</code></pre>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.sstatic.net/abc.png\" alt=\"screenshot\" /></p>\n\n<p>I&#39;d happily pay $5/month for something that just works.</p>\n"
    },
